      "route-token and native-inventory conservation unchanged",
      "old executor rejects new flag, old exact-input encoding unchanged"
    ],
    "propagation": "Family issuer -> generic native boundary -> production amount selector -> encoded flow; no off-chain Exact or quoted fallback",
